  "title": "Tiny Pecan Tarts",
  "description": "Cute little pecan tarts made from scratch with cream cheese pastry and a rich, buttery pecan and vanilla filling. Perfect for holiday cookie trays!",
  "authors": [
    "Sandy Greathouse"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-12-20T08:33:46-05:00",
